  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Whisk olive oil, soy sauce, honey, lemon juice, minced garlic, smoked paprika, salt, and pepper in a bowl.",
    "Toss wagyu cubes in the glaze and refrigerate 15 minutes.",
    "Thread marinated cubes onto metal or soaked bamboo skewers.",
    "Grill skewers for 3-4 minutes per side until desired doneness.",
    "Brush remaining glaze over the skewers during the last minute of cooking.",
    "Remove skewers from grill and let rest 5 minutes.",
    "Serve immediately with a sprinkle of fresh parsley and a wedge of lemon."
  ],
